---
const title = "Privacy Policy | DollarDost";
const description = "Learn how DollarDost handles calculator inputs, website information, privacy and contact enquiries.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://dollardost.pages.dev/privacy-policy/" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a" />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: #172033;
        background: #f8fafc;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      a { color: #15803d; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
      .container { width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: auto; }
      .header-inner {
        min-height: 68px; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;
      }
      .logo { color: #0f172a; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -1px; }
      .logo span { color: #16a34a; }
      nav { display: flex; gap: 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 650; }
      nav a { color: #172033; }
      main { padding: 42px 0 64px; }
      article {
        background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 18px;
        padding: clamp(22px, 5vw, 42px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, .045);
      }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 42px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -1px; }
      h2 { margin: 30px 0 8px; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
      p, li { color: #475569; }
      .updated { margin: 0 0 28px; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      footer { padding: 22px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
      .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 0; gap: 6px; }
        nav { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Dollar<span>Dost</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/creator-stack-calculator/">Creator Stack</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <article>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 27 November 2026</p>

        <p>
          DollarDost ("we", "us" or "our") provides online calculators and
          informational tools for creators, freelancers and people receiving
          international income. This Privacy Policy explains how information
          may be handled when you visit
          <a href="https://dollardost.pages.dev/">dollardost.pages.dev</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information you enter into our calculators</h2>
        <p>
          Our current calculators are designed to process the amounts, rates,
          fees and other values you enter in your browser to produce an
          estimate. Based on the current website code, these calculator inputs
          are not intentionally submitted to a DollarDost account or database.
          We do not currently provide user accounts or login functionality.
        </p>
        <p>
          Please do not enter passwords, bank account numbers, payment-card
          details, government identification numbers or other sensitive
          personal information into calculator fields.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Technical information and hosting</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is hosted using Cloudflare Pages. Like other website
          hosting and delivery providers, Cloudflare may process technical
          information when a visitor requests a page. Depending on its
          services and configuration, this may include IP address, browser
          and device information, requested URLs, timestamps, diagnostic data
          and security-related logs.
        </p>
        <p>
          Such processing is subject to the hosting provider's own terms and
          privacy practices. You can review
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Cookies, analytics and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          The current DollarDost website code we reviewed does not intentionally
          use advertising pixels, analytics scripts, or browser cookies and
          storage to track calculator inputs. Hosting or security infrastructure
          may use technical mechanisms where necessary to deliver or protect
          the website. If we add analytics, advertising or other tracking
          technologies in the future, we will update this policy to explain
          them.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Information you send us</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact us by email, we will receive the information you
          choose to include, such as your email address, message and any details
          needed to respond. We use that information to handle your enquiry,
          provide support and maintain relevant correspondence. Please avoid
          sending sensitive financial or identity information by email.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-party websites</h2>
        <p>
          DollarDost may link to external websites, platforms, payment
          providers, government services or other resources. Those websites
          operate under their own privacy policies and terms. We do not control
          their information practices, so please review their policies before
          providing information to them.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data sharing and sale</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell personal information. We do not intentionally share
          calculator entries with platforms or payment providers. Technical
          information may be processed by our hosting and security providers
          as described above, and information may be disclosed where required
          by applicable law or to protect the website and its users.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data security and retention</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable care in operating the website, but no internet
          transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely
          secure. Emails you send us may be retained for as long as reasonably
          necessary to respond, maintain records or address follow-up matters.
          Technical logs are handled according to the hosting provider's
          retention practices.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your choices and privacy requests</h2>
        <p>
          You can choose not to use our calculators or not to contact us.
          If you have a question or request concerning personal information
          you have sent to DollarDost, contact us using the email address below.
          We will review and respond to requests as required by applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          DollarDost is intended for a general audience and is not designed
          to knowingly collect personal information from children. Please
          contact us if you believe a child has sent us personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy when our tools, website
          functionality or information practices change. The "Last updated"
          date at the top indicates when this page was most recently revised.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions or requests, email
          <a href="mailto:dollardost92@gmail.com">dollardost92@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container footer-inner">
        <span>© 2026 DollarDost. Made for the world's global earners.</span>
        <span><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
